                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} j^\infty_\Sigma(\Phi)
              is the jet prolongation of
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi Φ
